license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LizzoLizard/quiet-collisions-math"
url: "https://lizzolizard.github.io/quiet-collisions-math/"
abstract: >-
  Exact minimum ordered-collision excess of a non-bijective, degree-k map over GF(2) whose
  output is d-wise uniform: 2^max(ceil(n/k), d+1); and 2^max(2 ceil(n/k) - m, ceil(n/k), d+1)
  for compressing maps F_2^n -> F_2^m. Paper and complete Lean 4 proof.
keywords:
  - Boolean functions
  - Polynomial maps over GF(2)
  - k-wise independence
  - Collision probability
  - Walsh-Hadamard transform
  - Reed-Muller codes
  - Lean 4
  - Formal verification
